0..79 Comment "//! This manifold deploys a migration model on two processes. The entry process"
80..106 Comment "//! runs `main` at `near`."
107..110 Comment "//!"
111..190 Comment "//! A manifold binds the worlds of a program onto sites. So one program runs as"
191..243 Comment "//! two processes. Its source names neither process."
244..247 Comment "//!"
248..325 Comment "//! The manifold deploys the migration model beside it and binds `far` to the"
326..401 Comment "//! imported site. The model of that site holds the key and the socket. The"
402..464 Comment "//! manifold places `near` nowhere. `gandr run --manifold` and"
465..517 Comment "//! `gandr host --manifold` read the manifold as the"
518..593 Comment "//! `--world far=<key>@<ip:port>` that it desugars to. `gandr check` of the"
594..656 Comment "//! manifold resolves `far` against the worlds of the program."
657..660 Comment "//!"
661..693 Comment "//! - see: `two-processes.gandr`"
